   "title": "Anti-SIR protest LIVE updates: INDIA bloc's ‘public impeachment’ of CEC Gyanesh Kumar to take place today",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/anti-sir-protest-live-updates-public-impeachment-rahul-gandhi-cec-gyanesh-kumar-cjp-dipke-bora-chalo-dilli-march-news-101793418660900.html",
   "domain": "hindustantimes.com",
