   "title": "Keralam’s 70th anniversary marks beginning of dream journey to become India’s best State: CM",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/keralams-70th-anniversary-marks-beginning-of-dream-journey-to-become-indias-best-state-cm/article71644261.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
