   "title": "Alake denies $700bn minerals sale, inaugurates Nigeria-US committee",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/10/alake-denies-700bn-minerals-sale-inaugurates-nigeria-us-committee/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
   "source": "vanguardngr.com",
   "published": "Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:08:12 +0000",
