   "title": "Senate asks Tinubu to rename education institution after late Afenifere leader, Reuben Fasoranti",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/regional/ssouth-west/921103-senate-asks-tinubu-to-rename-education-institution-after-late-afenifere-leader-reuben-fasoranti.html",
   "domain": "premiumtimesng.com",
   "source": "Premium Times（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:58:42 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793206722.0,
   "ageDays": 2.54,
   "summary": "The late elder statesman and Afenifere leader died last Tuesday.",
