   "summary": "Even the governors and National Assembly candidates of the APC are doing their posters alone without attaching the picture of Tinubu to these. Go through the billboards in the North, and you’ll notice that attaching Tinubu’s picture to your poster will create enmity for you and make you unpopular.",
   "summary_zh": "就连进步大会党的州长和国民议会候选人也各自张贴自己的海报，不在海报上附上蒂努布的照片。查看北方的广告牌，你会发现，在自己的海报上附上蒂努布的照片会招致敌意，使你不得人心。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "Even the governors and National Assembly candidates of the APC are doing their posters alone without attaching the picture of Tinubu to these. Go through the billboards in the North, and you’ll notice that attaching Tinubu’s picture to your poster will create enmity for you and make you unpopular. Elections are not won by emotions […] The post appeared first on Premium Times Nigeria",
