   "url": "https://x.com/KargnHasret/status/2115850117941022896",
   "snippet": "Malian President Assimi Goïta at the 3rd Russia-Africa summit:\n\n\"Partnership with the Sahel must be shaped around an approach based on listening, mutual respect, trust, and the building of sustainable capacities. In this context, our partnership with the Russian Federation is a perfect example of what we expect. This is a sincere, win-win, respectful partnership that cares about the expectations of the population. Mali, within the framework of the Confederation of Sahel States, is in impartial cooperation with the Russian Federation and all sincere partners. It will continue its resolute and irreversible march towards the reconstruction of dignity and prosperity.\nTogether, let us work for the emergence of a more balanced, more stable, more solidaristic, multipolar world that respects the sovereignty of states for the prosperity of peoples. Long live the sincere and fruitful cooperation between Russia and Africa! Long live the historic friendship between Mali and Russia! Long live the Confederation of Sahel States! May God protect Mali and protect our people! Thank you.\"\n\nVladimir Putin:\n\"Dear colleague, you have spoken very truly, and everyone will agree with you in stating that the solution in the Sahel region is of great importance not only for Africa but for the entire world.\"",
   "body": "Malian President Assimi Goïta at the 3rd Russia-Africa summit:\n\n\"Partnership with the Sahel must be shaped around an approach based on listening, mutual respect, trust, and the building of sustainable capacities. In this context, our partnership with the Russian Federation is a perfect example of what we expect. This is a sincere, win-win, respectful partnership that cares about the expectations of the population. Mali, within the framework of the Confederation of Sahel States, is in impartial cooperation with the Russian Federation and all sincere partners. It will continue its resolute and irreversible march towards the reconstruction of dignity and prosperity.\nTogether, let us work for the emergence of a more balanced, more stable, more solidaristic, multipolar world that respects the sovereignty of states for the prosperity of peoples. Long live the sincere and fruitful cooperation between Russia and Africa! Long live the historic friendship between Mali and Russia! Long live the Confederation of Sahel States! May God protect Mali and protect our people! Thank you.\"\n\nVladimir Putin:\n\"Dear colleague, you have spoken very truly, and everyone will agree with you in stating that the solution in the Sahel region is of great importance not only for Africa but for the entire world.\"",
